			</span></i>; <i>offer instead</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτου ἐφιέμενος ἀ. ἄλλο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1159b14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
